              <div class="form-details">
                <p><strong>Registration Form Link:</strong></p>
                <p style="text-align: center;">
                  <a href="{{form_link}}" class="button">Complete Vendor Registration</a>
                </p>
                {{#if notes}}
                  <p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> {{notes}}</p>
                {{/if}}
              </div>

              <p>This form will allow you to submit your business information, upload required 
                documents, and begin the vendor onboarding process with us.</p>

              <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact 
                our procurement team.</p>

